  "description": "Baek Seol-jun, the new Director of the Sales Department, is handsome but cold and intimidating—so much so that he drains the energy from everyone at work.\n\nRami, who always had bad luck with men, thinks he’s just another terrible match.\n\nBut then, Seol-jun tells her she carries the unforgettable scent of someone who once saved his life.\n\nHe asks to smell her scent, and though it feels strange, Rami can’t bring herself to refuse.\n\nAs he gently leans into her neck, her heart races in a way she didn’t expect.\n\nTheir bond deepened like a lingering perfume, and Seol-jun asks for a chance.\n\nRami’s nervousness fades, replaced by excitement.\n\nCould he be her long awaited destined bond? \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61308852), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%84%88%EB%8A%94-%EB%8B%AC%EC%95%84/3343)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/153160)",
